<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - RJR Nabisco Holdings.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - RJR Nabisco Holdings.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Martin Feldman said he reiterated an outperform, high risk rating on RJR Nabisco Holdings Corp .</p>
<p>-- said he expects RJR Nabisco's dividends per share to rise to $2.05 and its 1997 share buy back program to exceed $200 million.</p>
<p>-- said he boosted its fourth quarter 1997 earnings estimate to $0.83 a share from $0.82 a share and raised the full year 1997 estimate to $2.95 a share from $2.94 a share.</p>
<p>-- RJR Nabisco gained 3/8 to 32-3/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
